      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神鹰也不能输给她！！\n必须靠吃肉增加持久力，努力变强才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3500f45f76b68a777bc85f41bd7894d8fcfc88a5f0068d4bae131214501974c",
