      "uid": "zhcn:e40b37a00ab0118736719b8e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的名字叫“山鹰”，\n也跟神鹰有点像！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dd8387460edd89380e03f08c415a1babc8b018a3880fc9c7b329be1245ecf0e",
