    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e800a5c7118a7a0fa1532a79",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但因为一场美好的比赛与偶遇，\n让这天成了难以忘怀的愉快日子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1d750535c3ff361b0c12c26b8a4fcddf0e107d22d35c159017d9cb39f4edfdd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
